==English==

===Etymology===
From the expression ''the [[early bird catches the worm]]''.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[early]] [[bird]]}}

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} A [[person]] who [[wake]]s [[early]] or [[arrive]]s early, typically before most others.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|one who wakes early}} [[early riser]], [[morning person]]

====Antonyms====
* [[nighthawk]], [[night owl]], [[night person]]

